{
  "about": [
    "Jan's guard for ping-pong A/B updates: one table, two implementations.",
    "test_slot_manager.py runs `rq_slot_manager.sh plan-update <tag>` on a fake card for every case;",
    "test_release_notice.py runs rq_release_notice.plan_update(tag, target, running), the copy the",
    "taskbar indicator uses for its warnings. Both must give `expect` exactly, so a rule changed on",
    "one side only fails the other side's tests.",
    "target / running: what the slot holds - a version (first line of /etc/rasqberry-version),",
    "EMPTY (no system), INCOMPLETE (an interrupted update) or SYSTEM (no version file).",
    "Streams: development-*, dev-* -> dev; beta-* -> beta; v1.2.3, 1.2.3, stable-* -> stable;",
    "anything else -> unknown (ranks like dev, never counts as safe). Beta compares by date,",
    "stable by version (sort -V); dev over dev never warns."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {"why": "dev over dev: no warning",
     "tag": "development-2026-10-05-010101", "target": "development-2026-10-04-014357", "running": "beta-2026-10-15-101010",
     "expect": {"target_holds": "dev development-2026-10-04-014357", "running_holds": "beta beta-2026-10-15-101010",
                "new": "dev development-2026-10-05-010101", "downgrade": "none", "last_safe_slot": "no"}},
    {"why": "dev over dev never warns, even an older build",
     "tag": "dev-ab-pingpong-2026-09-01-000000", "target": "development-2026-10-04-014357", "running": "beta-2026-10-15-101010",
     "expect": {"target_holds": "dev development-2026-10-04-014357", "running_holds": "beta beta-2026-10-15-101010",
                "new": "dev dev-ab-pingpong-2026-09-01-000000", "downgrade": "none", "last_safe_slot": "no"}},
    {"why": "beta over dev: an upgrade",
